<https://w3id.org/desmos/revealsConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of isRevealedBy: this property relates a textual feature to the literary constraint it makes identifiable. The property has domain desmos:TextualFeature and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@en .
